{"sectionId":"phase/forces","items":[{"id":"phase--forces-k001","sectionId":"phase/forces","unitId":"phase","subject":"chemistry","text":"London 분산력은 순간 쌍극자와 유도 쌍극자에 의해 발생하며 모든 원자·분자에 존재한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"phase--forces-k002","sectionId":"phase/forces","unitId":"phase","subject":"chemistry","text":"극성 분자는 쌍극자-쌍극자 상호작용을, 적절한 donor와 acceptor를 가진 분자는 수소결합을 형성한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"phase--forces-k003","sectionId":"phase/forces","unitId":"phase","subject":"chemistry","text":"이온-쌍극자 힘은 이온 용매화에 중요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"phase--forces-k004","sectionId":"phase/forces","unitId":"phase","subject":"chemistry","text":"분극률과 접촉면적은 분산력에 영향을 주고 분자 간 인력이 커지면 다른 조건이 비슷할 때 끓는점·점도·표면장력이 높아지는 경향이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"phase--forces-k005","sectionId":"phase/forces","unitId":"phase","subject":"chemistry","text":"증기압은 일정 온도에서 액체와 증기의 평형 압력이며 끓는점은 증기압이 외압과 같아지는 온도다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"phase--forces-k006","sectionId":"phase/forces","unitId":"phase","subject":"chemistry","text":"상평형도는 안정한 고체·액체·기체 영역과 공존선을 나타낸다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"phase--forces-k007","sectionId":"phase/forces","unitId":"phase","subject":"chemistry","text":"삼중점에서는 세 상이 공존하고 임계점 이상의 액체·기체 구분은 사라진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"phase--forces-k008","sectionId":"phase/forces","unitId":"phase","subject":"chemistry","text":"Clausius–Clapeyron 근사 ln(P₂/P₁)=−ΔHvap/R(1/T₂−1/T₁)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"phase--forces-k009","sectionId":"phase/forces","unitId":"phase","subject":"chemistry","text":"Clapeyron 식 dP/dT=ΔS/ΔV에 따라 물의 보통 얼음-액체 경계는 음의 기울기를 가진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"phase--forces-k010","sectionId":"phase/forces","unitId":"phase","subject":"chemistry","text":"증기압은 온도가 높을수록 증가한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"phase--forces-k011","sectionId":"phase/forces","unitId":"phase","subject":"chemistry","text":"높은 외압은 보통 끓는점을 높인다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"phase--forces-k012","sectionId":"phase/forces","unitId":"phase","subject":"chemistry","text":"일반적인 얼음은 액체 물보다 밀도가 작다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"phase--forces-k013","sectionId":"phase/forces","unitId":"phase","subject":"chemistry","text":"가열곡선의 상변화 구간에서는 열이 잠열에 쓰인다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"phase--forces-k014","sectionId":"phase/forces","unitId":"phase","subject":"chemistry","text":"외압이 낮아 낮은 온도에서도 증기압이 외압과 같아지기 때문이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}